<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>K-MediWell — 더 치유시대를 위한 플랫폼</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Song+Myung&family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@500;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --ink:#1c2b24; --ink-soft:#5b665f; --ink-faint:#8b9089;
  --paper:#f4efe3; --paper-2:#eae1cc; --paper-3:#ded2b3;
  --jade:#1f4b3e; --jade-light:#3c6e5a; --jade-pale:#dfe9e2;
  --seal:#b23a2e; --seal-dark:#8a2a20;
  --gold:#b8892b; --silver:#8b93a0; --bronze:#9c6b3e;
  --line:#cfc4a4;
  --radius:10px;
  --shadow:0 2px 14px rgba(31,75,62,.08);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
  margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink);
  font-family:'Noto Sans KR',sans-serif; line-height:1.65;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
h1,h2,h3,.disp{font-family:'Song Myung',serif; letter-spacing:.01em; color:var(--jade); font-weight:400;}
.mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
a{color:inherit}
button{font-family:inherit; cursor:pointer;}
::selection{background:var(--jade); color:var(--paper);}

/* ---- top ribbon ---- */
.ribbon{
  background:var(--jade); color:var(--paper); font-size:12.5px;
  text-align:center; padding:6px 12px; letter-spacing:.02em;
}
.ribbon b{font-weight:700}

/* ---- header / nav ---- */
header{
  position:sticky; top:0; z-index:40; background:rgba(244,239,227,.92);
  backdrop-filter:blur(6px); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.hd-inner{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:28px; padding:14px 24px;}
.logo{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-family:'Song Myung',serif; font-size:22px; color:var(--jade); white-space:nowrap; cursor:pointer;}
.logo .mark{width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; border:1.6px solid var(--jade); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;}
nav.tabs{display:flex; gap:2px; flex:1; overflow-x:auto; scrollbar-width:none;}
nav.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
nav.tabs button{
  background:none; border:none; padding:9px 14px; font-size:14.5px; color:var(--ink-soft);
  border-radius:8px; white-space:nowrap; transition:all .15s;
}
nav.tabs button:hover{background:var(--paper-2); color:var(--ink);}
nav.tabs button.active{background:var(--jade); color:var(--paper); font-weight:500;}
.hd-right{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;}
.locale-select{
  border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--paper); border-radius:8px; padding:7px 10px; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-soft);
}
.auth-pill{
  border:1px solid var(--jade); color:var(--jade); background:none; border-radius:20px; padding:7px 16px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; white-space:nowrap;
}
.auth-pill.on{background:var(--jade); color:var(--paper); border-color:var(--jade);}

/* ---- shell ---- */
main{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px 90px;}
.view{display:none; animation:fadein .35s ease;}
.view.active{display:block;}
@keyframes fadein{from{opacity:0; transform:translateY(6px)} to{opacity:1; transform:translateY(0)}}

/* ---- hero ---- */
.hero{position:relative; padding:64px 0 40px; overflow:hidden;}
.hero-wave{position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:38px; height:120px; opacity:.5; pointer-events:none;}
.hero-eyebrow{font-size:12.5px; letter-spacing:.14em; color:var(--seal); font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:14px;}
.hero h1{font-size:44px; line-height:1.28; margin:0 0 18px; max-width:760px;}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal; color:var(--seal);}
.hero p.lead{font-size:16.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:600px; margin:0 0 30px;}
.hero-ctas{display:flex; gap:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; position:relative; z-index:2;}
.btn{
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; border-radius:8px; padding:13px 22px; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500;
  border:1.5px solid var(--jade); transition:all .15s;
}
.btn-primary{background:var(--jade); color:var(--paper);}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--jade-light); border-color:var(--jade-light);}
.btn-ghost{background:none; color:var(--jade);}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--jade-pale);}
.btn-seal{border-color:var(--seal); color:var(--seal);}
.btn-seal:hover{background:#f7e9e7;}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.45; cursor:not-allowed;}

/* ---- chips ---- */
.chiprow{display:flex; gap:9px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:34px 0 6px;}
.chip{
  border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--paper); border-radius:20px; padding:8px 16px; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--ink-soft);
}
.chip.active{background:var(--jade); border-color:var(--jade); color:var(--paper); font-weight:500;}

/* ---- section heads ---- */
.sec-head{display:flex; align-items:baseline; justify-content:space-between; margin:52px 0 20px;}
.sec-head h2{font-size:24px; margin:0;}
.sec-head .num{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-right:8px;}
.sec-head .see-all{font-size:13px; color:var(--jade); border-bottom:1px dotted var(--jade); padding-bottom:1px;}

/* ---- cards ---- */
.grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(255px,1fr)); gap:18px;}
.card{
  background:#fffdf8; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); overflow:hidden; cursor:pointer;
  transition:transform .18s, box-shadow .18s; display:flex; flex-direction:column;
}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px); box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
.card-media{
  height:128px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; position:relative;
  font-family:'Song Myung',serif; font-size:15px; color:#fff; text-align:center; padding:0 16px;
}
.card-body{padding:15px 16px 17px;}
.card-cat{font-size:11px; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--jade-light); font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px;}
.card-title{font-size:15.5px; font-weight:500; color:var(--ink); margin:0 0 6px; line-height:1.4;}
.card-sub{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0;}
.card-foot{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:12px;}
.price{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500; color:var(--ink);}

/* seal badge */
.seal-badge{
  position:absolute; top:10px; right:10px; width:52px; height:52px; border-radius:50%;
  border:2px solid #fff; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; flex-direction:column;
  transform:rotate(-9deg); font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif; color:#fff; box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}
.seal-badge span{font-size:9px; letter-spacing:.04em;}
.seal-badge b{font-size:11px; font-weight:700;}
.tier-Gold{background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #d3a746, var(--gold));}
.tier-Silver{background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #a7afba, var(--silver));}
.tier-Bronze{background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #b98254, var(--bronze));}

/* news strip */
.newsstrip{display:flex; gap:16px; overflow-x:auto; padding-bottom:6px; scrollbar-width:thin;}
.news-mini{
  min-width:250px; max-width:250px; background:#fffdf8; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:16px; cursor:pointer; transition:box-shadow .15s;
}
.news-mini:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow);}
.news-mini .flag{font-size:11px; color:var(--seal); font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.04em; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:8px;}
.news-mini h4{margin:0 0 8px; font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500; line-height:1.4; color:var(--ink);}
.news-mini .byline{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-faint);}

/* explore filter row */
.filterbar{display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:22px 0 26px; align-items:center;}
.filterbar .lbl{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-right:6px;}

/* detail layout */
.detail-wrap{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr; gap:36px; margin-top:20px;}
@media(max-width:860px){.detail-wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.detail-hero{height:220px; border-radius:var(--radius); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-family:'Song Myung',serif; font-size:20px; margin-bottom:22px; position:relative;}
.backbtn{background:none; border:none; color:var(--jade); font-size:13.5px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; margin:20px 0 6px; padding:0;}
.detail-side{background:#fffdf8; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:22px; height:fit-content;}
.detail-side .price-big{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:26px; color:var(--jade); margin:2px 0 4px;}
.kv{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:9px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--paper-2); font-size:13.5px;}
.kv:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.kv .k{color:var(--ink-faint);}

/* forms */
input[type=date],input[type=email],input[type=password],input[type=text],select{
  width:100%; padding:11px 13px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; background:#fffdf8; font-size:14px; color:var(--ink); font-family:inherit;
}
label.field{display:block; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:14px 0 6px;}

/* journey */
.stat-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:14px; margin:24px 0 34px;}
.stat{background:#fffdf8; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:18px;}
.stat .lbl{font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-bottom:6px;}
.stat .val{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:26px; color:var(--jade);}
.chart-box{background:#fffdf8; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:24px; margin-bottom:30px;}
.book-row{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding:14px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--paper-2);}
.book-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.status-pill{font-size:11.5px; padding:4px 11px; border-radius:20px; background:var(--jade-pale); color:var(--jade); font-weight:500;}

/* measure */
.measure-wrap{max-width:560px; margin:30px auto 0; text-align:center;}
.gauge{width:220px; height:220px; margin:26px auto; position:relative;}
.wave-band{display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:22px; margin:34px 0;}
.wave-band .b{text-align:center;}
.wave-band .bar{width:34px; height:90px; background:var(--paper-2); border-radius:6px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; margin:0 auto 8px;}
.wave-band .bar .fill{position:absolute; bottom:0; left:0; right:0; background:var(--jade); border-radius:6px; transition:height 1s ease;}
.rec-box{background:var(--jade-pale); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:22px; margin-top:20px; text-align:left;}

/* auth */
.psst-table{width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13.5px;}
.psst-table th{background:var(--jade); color:var(--paper); text-align:left; padding:10px 12px; font-weight:500;}
.psst-table td{padding:10px 12px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--paper-2); color:var(--ink);}
.psst-table tbody tr:nth-child(even) td{background:var(--paper-2);}
.psst-h3{font-family:'Song Myung',serif; color:var(--jade); font-size:19px; margin:30px 0 12px;}
.bmc{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr); grid-template-rows:auto auto; gap:10px; margin:20px 0;}
.bmc .cell{background:#fffdf8; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:14px;}
.bmc .cell h5{margin:0 0 8px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--seal); font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.03em;}
.bmc .cell p{margin:0; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); line-height:1.55;}
.bmc .c-partners{grid-row:1/3;}
.bmc .c-value{grid-row:1/3;}
.bmc .c-customer{grid-row:1/3;}
.bmc .c-activities{}
.bmc .c-relation{}
.bmc .c-resources{}
.bmc .c-channels{}
.bmc .c-cost{grid-column:1/3;}
.bmc .c-revenue{grid-column:3/6;}
@media(max-width:900px){.bmc{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;} .bmc .cell{grid-row:auto !important; grid-column:auto !important;}}
.progressline{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; margin:12px 0;}
.progressline .plabel{width:110px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); flex-shrink:0;}
.progressline .ptrack{flex:1; height:10px; background:var(--paper-2); border-radius:6px; overflow:hidden;}
.progressline .pfill{height:100%; background:var(--jade); border-radius:6px;}
.progressline .pval{width:66px; text-align:right; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; color:var(--jade); flex-shrink:0;}
.stepflow{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:18px 0;}
.stepflow .step{background:var(--jade-pale); color:var(--jade); border-radius:8px; padding:10px 16px; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
.stepflow .arrow{color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:16px;}
.year-badge{position:absolute; top:10px; right:10px; background:#fffdf8; color:var(--ink); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; font-weight:500; padding:4px 9px; border-radius:20px; box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.18);}
.no-badge{position:absolute; top:10px; right:10px; width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:50%; background:#fffdf8; color:var(--jade); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.18);}
.gov-source{font-size:11px; color:var(--ink-faint); margin-top:8px;}
.auth-card{max-width:400px; margin:50px auto; background:#fffdf8; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--radius); padding:34px;}
.auth-tabbar{display:flex; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); margin-bottom:22px;}
.auth-tabbar button{flex:1; background:none; border:none; padding:11px; font-size:14px; color:var(--ink-faint); border-bottom:2px solid transparent;}
.auth-tabbar button.active{color:var(--jade); border-bottom-color:var(--jade); font-weight:500;}

/* empty / note */
.notebox{background:var(--paper-2); border-left:3px solid var(--jade); border-radius:0 8px 8px 0; padding:14px 18px; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:18px 0;}
.disc{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-faint); text-align:center; padding:30px 0 10px;}

/* ebook detail flip */
.ebook-cover{
  aspect-ratio:3/4; border-radius:8px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:22px; text-align:center;
  font-family:'Song Myung',serif; color:#fff; font-size:15px; line-height:1.4;
}
.heart{border:none; background:none; font-size:20px; color:var(--seal);}

/* toast */
#toast{position:fixed; bottom:26px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px); background:var(--jade); color:var(--paper);
  padding:13px 24px; border-radius:8px; font-size:13.5px; opacity:0; pointer-events:none; transition:all .25s; z-index:100;}
#toast.show{opacity:1; transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);}

footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:34px 24px; text-align:center; color:var(--ink-faint); font-size:12.5px;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="ribbon">국립공주대학교 RISE사업단 선정 과제 &nbsp;·&nbsp; 「치유관광산업 육성에 관한 법률」(2026.4.9 시행) 기반 서비스 &nbsp;·&nbsp; <b>기능명세서 v0.8 프로토타입</b></div>

<header>
  <div class="hd-inner">
    <div class="logo" onclick="go('home')"><span class="mark">治</span>K-MediWell</div>
    <nav class="tabs" id="tabnav"></nav>
    <div class="hd-right">
      <select class="locale-select" id="localeSel" onchange="setLocale(this.value)">
        <option value="ko">한국어</option>
        <option value="en">English</option>
        <option value="zh">中文 (준비중)</option>
        <option value="ja">日本語 (준비중)</option>
        <option value="vi">Tiếng Việt (준비중)</option>
      </select>
      <button class="auth-pill" id="authPill" onclick="toggleAuth()">로그인</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

<!-- ============ HOME ============ -->
<section class="view active" id="view-home">
  <div class="hero">
    <svg class="hero-wave" viewBox="0 0 900 120" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path id="eegpath" d="M0,60 Q40,20 80,60 T160,60 T240,60 T320,60 T400,60 T480,60 T560,60 T640,60 T720,60 T800,60 T880,60" fill="none" stroke="#1f4b3e" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">더 치유시대를 위한 플랫폼</div>
    <h1>아리랑 500년의 치유를,<br><em>뇌파로 증명</em>하여 세계로</h1>
    <p class="lead">한국의 전통 치유문화 — 훈민정음·국악풍류·오정법·전일의학 — 를 전자북과 다국어 저널리즘, 뇌파(EEG) 기반 AX 인증으로 연결하는 K-치유관광 플랫폼입니다.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="go('measure')">지금 내 뇌파 측정하기 →</button>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" onclick="go('explore')">치유관광지 탐색하기</button>
    </div>
    <div class="chiprow" id="homeChips"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="sec-head"><h2><span class="num">01</span>치유관광타임즈</h2><a class="see-all" onclick="go('news')">전체 기사 보기 →</a></div>
  <div class="newsstrip" id="newsStrip"></div>

  <div class="sec-head"><h2><span class="num">02</span>외래객 특화 웰니스관광지 20선</h2><a class="see-all" onclick="go('explore')">전체 탐색 →</a></div>
  <div class="grid" id="top20Grid"></div>

  <div class="sec-head"><h2><span class="num">03</span>치유전자북</h2><a class="see-all" onclick="go('ebooks')">전자북 스토어 →</a></div>
  <div class="grid" id="homeEbooks"></div>
</section>

<!-- ============ EXPLORE ============ -->
<section class="view" id="view-explore">
  <div class="sec-head" style="margin-top:44px"><h2>치유관광지 탐색</h2></div>
  <p style="color:var(--ink-soft); max-width:640px">문체부·한국관광공사 공식 선정 웰니스관광 88선 중 외래객 특화 20선을 우선 등재했습니다. 각 시설의 AX 인증 등급은 뇌파(EEG) 측정 데이터를 근거로 부여됩니다.</p>
  <div class="filterbar"><span class="lbl">카테고리</span><div id="catChips" style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap"></div></div>
  <div class="grid" id="exploreGrid"></div>

  <div class="sec-head"><h2 style="font-size:20px">웰니스관광지 88선 전체</h2></div>
  <p style="color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:13.5px; max-width:640px">문체부·한국관광공사 공식 선정 88개소 전체를 테마별로 분류해 등재했습니다. 카드를 클릭하면 각 시설의 공식 홈페이지(확인된 곳) 또는 웹 검색 결과로 이동합니다.</p>
  <div class="filterbar" id="explore88Chips" style="margin:14px 0 18px"></div>
  <div class="grid" id="explore88Table"></div>

  <div class="sec-head"><h2 style="font-size:20px">외래객 유치 특화 웰니스관광지 20선 + 1</h2></div>
  <p style="color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:13.5px; max-width:640px">2026년도 외래객 유치 특화 웰니스관광지 20선 원문에, K-MediWell 협업 시설을 21번으로 추가 등재했습니다. 원문 그대로 순서를 유지하며 별도 테마 재분류는 하지 않았습니다.</p>
  <div class="grid" id="explore20Table" style="margin-top:18px"></div>
</section>

<section class="view" id="view-siteDetail"></section>
<section class="view" id="view-booking"></section>
<section class="view" id="view-bookingDone"></section>

